        "text": [
          "Nib trades his\ncommission bonus\nfor a city\nbuyer-service\ngrant. Future",
          "property purchases\ncost 20 fewer\nCoins. The\ndiscount applies\nwhen you buy, with",
          "no refund on\nearlier purchases."
        ],
